  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      217.49,
      401.85,
      254.99
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO PROVIDE FOR THE FORMULATION AND REGISTRATION OFKATHIKAWATH IN RELATION TO NIKAYA OR CHAPTERS OF THERAVADIBHIKKUS IN SRI LANKA; TO PROVIDE FOR EVERY BHIKKU TO ACT",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      256.61,
      401.85,
      293.87
    ],
    "text": "IN COMPLIANCE WITH THE PROVISIONS OF THE REGISTEREDKATHIKAWATH OF THE NIKAYA OR CHAPTER WHICH RELATES TO SUCHBHIKKU; TO IMPOSE PUNISHMENT ON BHIKKUS WHO ACT IN VIOLATION",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      295.49,
      401.85,
      306.83
    ],
    "text": "OF THE PROVISIONS OF ANY REGISTERED KATHIKAWATH, AND FOR",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      308.69,
      368.11,
      320.03
    ],
    "text": "MATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH OR INCIDENTAL THERETO.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      334.61,
      401.9,
      358.91
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      373.49,
      401.89,
      398.03
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Theravadi BhikkuKathikawath (Registration) Act, No. of 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      412.61,
      401.89,
      476.03
    ],
    "text": "2.(1) The Karaka Sangha Sabha of each TheravadiBhikku Nikaya or Chapter (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cNikaya or Chapter\u201d) may for the purpose of this Actformulate and adopt a Kathikawath pertaining to that Nikayaor Chapter.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      490.61,
      401.87,
      514.91
    ],
    "text": "(2) Every Kathikawath referred to in subsection (1) shall,inter alia, have provisions pertaining to:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.69,
      529.49,
      401.87,
      554.03
    ],
    "text": "(a)the composition and functions of the KarakaSangha Sabha of the relevant Nikaya or Chapter;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.69,
      568.61,
      401.86,
      592.91
    ],
    "text": "(b)a code of conduct and discipline to be strictlyfollowed by a bhikku in conducting himself;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      178.41,
      607.49,
      401.88,
      644.99
    ],
    "text": "(c)the manner of conducting inquiries in case ofviolations by any bhikku of the code of conductand discipline referred to in paragraph (b); and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.69,
      659.57,
      331.29,
      670.91
    ],
    "text": "(d)punishments for such violations.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      375.55,
      447.7,
      384.62
    ],
    "text": "Short Title.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      413.71,
      454.42,
      441.98
    ],
    "text": "FormulationofKathikawath.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
