  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      203.33,
      397.18,
      240.11
    ],
    "text": "(3) The code of conduct and discipline referred to inparagraph (b) of subsection (2) may contain provisionspertaining to a bhikku\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.99,
      254.21,
      397.17,
      290.99
    ],
    "text": "(a)engaging in or carrying out occult practices orsimilar activities and giving publicity to suchactivities;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.99,
      305.09,
      359.01,
      316.43
    ],
    "text": "(b)involving in trade or business activities;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      330.29,
      391.18,
      341.63
    ],
    "text": "(c)obtaining driving licences and driving vehicles;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.99,
      355.73,
      397.19,
      392.51
    ],
    "text": "(d)engaging in any employment in the public orprivate sector other than in the fields of education,social services or religious affairs; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      406.61,
      397.16,
      430.67
    ],
    "text": "(e)engaging in activities unsuitable for a bhikku in amanner contrary to bhikku vinaya in public places.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      444.77,
      397.17,
      468.83
    ],
    "text": "(4) For the purposes of paragraph (d) of subsection (2) thefollowing punishments may be included in a Kathikawath:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.99,
      482.69,
      383.75,
      494.03
    ],
    "text": "(a)temporary expulsion from the residing temple;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.99,
      508.13,
      385.17,
      519.47
    ],
    "text": "(b)permanent expulsion from the residing temple;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      533.57,
      397.18,
      557.63
    ],
    "text": "(c)temporary removal from the office ofviharadhipathy;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.99,
      571.73,
      397.19,
      595.79
    ],
    "text": "(d)permanent removal from the office ofviharadhipathy;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      609.89,
      323.72,
      621.23
    ],
    "text": "(e)expulsion from the studentship;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      635.09,
      397.16,
      646.43
    ],
    "text": "(f)expulsion from the relevant Nikaya or Chapter; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.99,
      660.53,
      353.73,
      671.87
    ],
    "text": "(g)cancellation of the bhikku registration.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
