  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      202.85,
      401.91,
      284.99
    ],
    "text": "3.(1) The Registrar Thero of the relevant Nikaya orChapter shall submit the Kathikawath formulated andadopted under section 2, to the Commissioner-General forregistration along with a duly completed application and astatement signed by the most Venerable MahanayakeThero of such Nikaya or Chapter to the effect that theKathikawath was duly adopted by the Karaka Sangha Sabha.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      297.17,
      401.88,
      320.27
    ],
    "text": "(2) The form and manner of such application shall beprescribed.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      332.69,
      401.88,
      379.31
    ],
    "text": "4.(1) The Commissioner-General shall submit theKathikawath applied to be registered to a Panel of Expertsappointed under section 5 to examine whether suchKathikawath\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.69,
      391.49,
      401.85,
      402.83
    ],
    "text": "(a)contravenes the provisions of any written law; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.69,
      415.25,
      401.86,
      438.35
    ],
    "text": "(b)is in compliance with Buddhist dhamma vinayaand customs.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      450.53,
      401.9,
      544.43
    ],
    "text": "(2) Where the Panel of Experts is of the opinion that theprovisions of a Kathikawath contravens any of therequirements stipulated in subsection (1), it shallcommunicate such opinion to the Commissioner-Generalwho shall inform the same to the Registrar Thero of therelevant Nikaya or Chapter in order to revise the relevantKathikawath to be in compliance with such requirementsand resubmit it to the Panel of Experts for examination.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
