    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      203.09,
      401.89,
      226.67
    ],
    "text": "9.Where a Kathikawath pertaining to a Nikaya orChapter is registered under this Act\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      177.69,
      240.05,
      401.88,
      275.87
    ],
    "text": "(a)the provisions of such Kathikawath shall beapplicable to every bhikku who belongs to suchNikaya or Chapter; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      177.69,
      289.25,
      401.87,
      337.55
    ],
    "text": "(b)every bhikku belonging to such Nikaya or Chaptershall strictly adhere to and conduct himself inaccordance with, the provisions of suchKathikawath.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      350.69,
      401.87,
      411.23
    ],
    "text": "10.(1) Where a bhikku violates the provisions ofthe registered Kathikawath of the Nikaya or Chapter towhich such bhikku belongs, the Karaka Sangha Sabha ofthe relevant Nikaya or Chapter shall hold and inquiry inrespect thereof.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      424.61,
      401.93,
      460.43
    ],
    "text": "(2) At the inquiry specified in subsection (1), the bhikkualleged to have violated the provisions of such Kathikawathshall be given and opportunity to be heard.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      473.81,
      401.9,
      534.35
    ],
    "text": "(3) The Registrar Thero of the relevant Nikaya or Chaptershall handover the decision of the Karaka Sangha Sabha tothe bhikku alleged to have violated the provisions of aregistered Kathikawath personally or inform him of suchdecision by sending it to him through registered post.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      547.49,
      401.89,
      583.55
    ],
    "text": "11.(1) The bhikku alleged to have violated theprovisions of a registered Kathikawath shall act in accordancewith the decision of the Karaka Sangha Sabha.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      144.57,
      596.69,
      401.9,
      669.47
    ],
    "text": "(2) A bhikku who fails or refuses to comply with suchdecision shall be guilty of an offence under this Act andshall on conviction after summary trial by a Magistrate beliable to a fine not less than rupees fifty thousand or toimprisonment for a term not exceeding six months or bothsuch fine and imprisonment.30",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      205.63,
      454.42,
      262.7
    ],
    "text": "Bhikku shallcomply withtheprovisions oftheKathikawath.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      350.59,
      455.85,
      426.86
    ],
    "text": "Inquiry to beheldregardingcontraventionof theprovisions oftheKathikawath.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      547.87,
      455.85,
      614.54
    ],
    "text": "To actcontrary tothe decisionof the KarakaSanghaSabha to bean offence.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
