    ],
    "text": "Theravadi Bhikku Kathikawath (Registration)6",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      202.85,
      397.18,
      262.19
    ],
    "text": "12.A bhikku against whom and inquirty is pendingunder section 10 or who is guilty of an offecne under thisAct shall not be accepted or registered as a bhikku by anyNikaya or Chapter other than the Nikaya or Chapter to whichsuch bhikku belongs.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      274.85,
      397.18,
      322.19
    ],
    "text": "13.(1) Minister may in consultation with the mostVenerable Mahanayake Theros of the three Nikaya makeregulations for the purpose of implementation of or givingeffect to the principles or provisions of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      334.85,
      397.19,
      370.19
    ],
    "text": "(2) In particular and without prejudice to the generalityof the powers specified in subsection (1), the Minister maymake regulations in respect of the following matters:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      172.51,
      382.85,
      397.17,
      418.19
    ],
    "text": "(a)any matter required by this Act to be prescribed orin respect of which regulations are authorized bythis Act to be made;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      172.51,
      430.85,
      397.19,
      466.19
    ],
    "text": "(b)to specify the colour of the robe to be used by thebhikkus, as determined by the Mahanayaka Therosof the Three Nikaya; or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      173.23,
      478.85,
      397.17,
      502.19
    ],
    "text": "(c)to prescribe the Forms required for the purpose ofthis Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      514.85,
      397.19,
      562.19
    ],
    "text": "(3) Every regulation made under subsection (1) shall bepublished in the Gazette, and shall come into operation onthe date of such publication, or on such later date as may bespecified in the regulation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      574.85,
      397.15,
      610.19
    ],
    "text": "(4)(a) Every regulation made under subsection (1) shallas soon as convenient after its publication in the Gazette, bebrought before Parliament for its approval.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      622.85,
      397.18,
      670.43
    ],
    "text": "(b)Any regulation which is not so approved shall bedeemed to be rescinded as from the date of said disapprovalbut without prejudice to anything previously donethereunder.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
